# 主機設定：g02，論文的補充量測（投稿版的程式，原始碼雜湊 1bf4bc6d…）。原始碼與建置放在獨立目錄，
# 不動主目錄（/ssd/sclin/gpu-native-cfd/GPU-Native-CFD、build/），其他工作可以同時改它們。
HOST_PROFILE=g02-paper
OPENFOAM_BASHRC=/opt/atlas-openfoam/current/OpenFOAM-v2606/etc/bashrc
NVCC=/usr/local/cuda/bin/nvcc
CUDA_ARCHS=89
GNC_ROOT=/ssd/sclin/gpu-native-cfd/paper
SRC_DIR=/ssd/sclin/gpu-native-cfd/paper/GPU-Native-CFD
BUILD_ROOT=/ssd/sclin/gpu-native-cfd/paper/build
RUN_ROOT=/ssd/sclin/gpu-native-cfd/runs
CASE_ROOT=/home/sclin/hisa-gpu-research-cases
GPU_DEVICE=3
BUILD_JOBS=8
